#. The "Composing" section in the settings window
#: Text ID:Composing
msgid "Composing"
msgstr "Sammenfatting"

#: Text ID:UseXorgRulesToolTip
msgid "Use the 3,000 compose sequences from the Xorg project (http://www.x.org/). These are the sequences most commonly found on a standard Linux system."
msgstr "Bruk de 3 000 sammenfattingssekvensene fra Xorg-prosjektet (http://www.x.org/). Dette er sekvensene man oftest finner på et vanlig Linux-system."

#. The compose key deactivates itself after a certain configurable delay
#: Text ID:ResetTimeout
msgid "Reset timeout"
msgstr "Tidsavbrudd"

#: Text ID:InsertZwsp
msgid "Insert zero-width spaces in Office apps"
msgstr "Sett inn mellomrom uten bredde i Office-programmer"

#. The "Test Typing" section in the settings window
#: Text ID:TestTyping
msgid "Test Typing"
msgstr "Prøveskriving"

#. Message displayed in the notification area tooltip.
#: Text ID:UpdatesToolTip
msgid "Updates are available."
msgstr "Oppdateringer er tilgjengelige."

#: Text ID:AllowInjected
msgid "Allow Injected Keys"
msgstr "Tillat injiserte tastetrykk"

#: Text ID:AllowInjectedToolTip
msgid "Do not ignore keys sent by other software like AutoHotkey or Synergy"
msgstr "Ikke overse tastetrykk sendt av annen programvare, som AutoHotkey eller Synergy"

#: Text ID:CheckUpdates
msgid "Automatically check for updates"
msgstr "Se etter oppdateringer automatisk"

#: Text ID:CheckUpdatesToolTip
msgid "If enabled, WinCompose will connect to the Internet at regular intervals to check for new versions. Updates are not installed automatically."
msgstr "Hvis dette er på, kobler WinCompose seg til Internett med jevne mellomrom for å se etter nye versjoner. Oppdateringer installeres ikke automatisk."

#: Text ID:CaptureComposeKey
msgid "Please press a key to use as your compose key."
msgstr "Trykk på tasten du vil bruke som sammenfattingstast."

#. Text to show instead of a value in seconds when the reset timeout feature is disabled
#: Text ID:NoTimeout
msgid "No timeout"
msgstr "Uten tidsavbrudd"

#: Text ID:AlwaysCompose
msgid "Alternate compose key is always Compose"
msgstr "Alternativ sammenfattingstast er alltid Compose"

#: Text ID:TimeoutToolTip
msgid "If set, any compose sequence will be cancelled after a certain delay if no keyboard activity is detected."
msgstr "Hvis dette er satt, avbrytes enhver sammenfattingssekvens etter en viss forsinkelse dersom ingen tastaturaktivitet oppdages."

#. The short name of the compose key
#: Text ID:KeyCompose
msgid "Compose"
msgstr "Compose"

#: Text ID:AutoLaunchToolTip
msgid "If set, WinCompose will be started when the user logs in."
msgstr "Hvis dette er satt, startes WinCompose når brukeren logger inn."

#: Text ID:Accessibility
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Tilgjengelighet"

#: Text ID:MustHoldCapsLock
msgid "Caps Lock is only active while being held down"
msgstr "Caps Lock er bare aktiv mens tasten holdes nede"

#: Text ID:MustHoldCapsLockToolTip
msgid "Releasing the Caps Lock key will immediately disable it, instead of the more standard behaviour of having to press it a second time."
msgstr "Når Caps Lock-tasten slippes, slås den av umiddelbart, i stedet for den vanligere oppførselen der den må trykkes en gang til."

#: Text ID:RunElevated
msgid "Run with elevated privileges (recommended)"
msgstr "Kjør med forhøyede rettigheter (anbefalt)"

#: Text ID:RunElevatedToolTip
msgid "Composition will not work in some applications if WinCompose does not run with elevated privileges. This options reduces the chances that this will happen."
msgstr "Sammenfatting vil ikke fungere i enkelte programmer hvis WinCompose ikke kjører med forhøyede rettigheter. Dette valget reduserer sjansen for at det skjer."

#. Subtitle on the About tab identifying this build as a fork
#: Text ID:ForkTagline
msgid "PolyKybd fork of WinCompose"
msgstr "PolyKybd-forgrening av WinCompose"

#. Attribution line on the About tab
#: Text ID:ForkBasedOn
msgid "Based on the original WinCompose by Sam Hocevar and contributors."
msgstr "Basert på det opprinnelige WinCompose av Sam Hocevar og bidragsytere."

#. A button to open the original upstream project page
#: Text ID:VisitUpstream
msgid "Visit the original project"
msgstr "Besøk det opprinnelige prosjektet"

#. Note under the donation button on the About tab
#: Text ID:DonationNote
msgid "Donations go to Sam Hocevar, the original author."
msgstr "Donasjoner går til Sam Hocevar, den opprinnelige forfatteren."

#. Unicode designation “Cc” (https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.globalization.unicodecategory%28v=vs.110%29.aspx), see also Gucharmap translations (https://git.gnome.org/browse/gucharmap/tree/po)
#: Category ID:Control
msgid "Other, Control"
msgstr "Annet, kontroll"

#. Unicode designation “Lt” (https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.globalization.unicodecategory%28v=vs.110%29.aspx), see also Gucharmap translations (https://git.gnome.org/browse/gucharmap/tree/po)
#: Category ID:TitlecaseLetter
msgid "Letter, Titlecase"
msgstr "Bokstav, tittelstil"

#. Unicode designation “Me” (https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.globalization.unicodecategory%28v=vs.110%29.aspx), see also Gucharmap translations (https://git.gnome.org/browse/gucharmap/tree/po)
#: Category ID:EnclosingMark
msgid "Mark, Enclosing"
msgstr "Merke, omsluttende"

#. Unicode designation “Mn” (https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.globalization.unicodecategory%28v=vs.110%29.aspx), see also Gucharmap translations (https://git.gnome.org/browse/gucharmap/tree/po)
#: Category ID:NonSpacingMark
msgid "Mark, Non-Spacing"
msgstr "Merke, uten mellomrom"

#. A button on the About tab that opens the folder holding wincompose.log
#: Text ID:OpenLogFolder
msgid "Open Log File Location"
msgstr "Åpne loggfilens plassering"
